{{Quote|For thousands of years, Zygerria supplied slave labor to the galaxy. We prospered. Our customers prospered! Then the Jedi came.|Darts D'Nar|<ref name="Kidnapped" />}}
A '''conflict''' was fought by the [[Jedi Order]] against the [[Zygerrian Slave Empire]] to end their [[Slavery|slaving]] operations after they were outlawed in Republic space.<ref name="Zygerrian" /> Their defeat left many [[Zygerrian]]s such as [[Darts D'Nar]] and [[Atai Molec]] with a seething [[Anti-Jedi sentiment|hatred]] of the [[Jedi]].<ref name="Kidnapped" />

